1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,000
You're pulling my leg, aren't you?

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,000
No. I got cold feet at the last minute.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,000
Look, we don't have to see eye to eye on everything.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,000
But when things fall apart, I've got your back.

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,000
Then let's call it a day. We'll figure it out tomorrow.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,000
Deal. And this time, don't leave me hanging.

